# PartyOn Phase 3 sample server log (2026-11-03)
# Three real partyon-client processes on one machine: Andrew (session 1, organizer),
# Giovanna (session 2), and LaNaysha (session 3). In order:
#   - Giovanna and LaNaysha send CLAIM_ITEM Cake at the same moment: one 200, one 410
#   - LaNaysha sends a malformed RSVP and gets 300 with the reason
#   - Giovanna cancels (RSVP No): her Cake and Punch are released and everyone is notified
#   - Andrew claims the released Punch
#   - LaNaysha's client is killed without QUIT; the others keep working
#   - Giovanna (still RSVP No) tries to claim Balloons and is refused; she changes to
#     RSVP Maybe ("I'll drop them off") and the claim succeeds
#   - Giovanna and Andrew QUIT; the server is stopped with Ctrl+C and restarted,
#     and the saved party is loaded back ("Loaded 1 event")

